<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87808" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προ-κλητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>calling forth, challenging,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ μέλος π.,</span> of the partridge,
				<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				4.16
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ φωνῇ προκλητικὸν ἐπαλαλάζων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Marc.</u>
					7
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τοῦ μέλλοντος κεφαλαίου ἐπιχείρημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hermog.
					<u>Inv.</u>
					3.13
				</span></i>
			 (also in 
				Comp.
			, ibid.); <i>provocative of, stimulating,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.115.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.41
			</span></i>. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.624
			</span></i>, al.</div>
